{"answer_text":"For a five-person team you want something that's quick to set up, keeps the pipeline visible and doesn't need an admin. These are the strongest options right now:\n\n**Pipewell**\nEasy to adopt, but email features cost extra.\n\n**Northwind CRM**\nThe safe all-rounder: deep reporting and a large integration marketplace.\n\n**Sheetly**\nThe cheapest route: a shared sheet with CRM templates.\n\nTrial Pipewell and Northwind CRM side by side with a real week of deals — the better fit is usually obvious by Friday.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50a3-7328-9fb9-de2958bfd0ff","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.006,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:08.050Z","engine":"google_ai_mode","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["easiest crm small business reviews","best crm for small sales team 2026"],"latency_ms":12030,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[166,174],[391,399]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[226,239],[404,417]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889f843f0cde","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Sheetly","name_text":"Sheetly","offsets":[[319,326]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."}],